    "部分照片开启 iCloud 照片后只保存在云端。关闭联网下载时，应用不会主动联网；如果只想离线查看，可以打开“仅显示已下载到本地的照片”，先去系统相册下载好再回来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some iCloud Photos originals are stored only in the cloud. When network downloads are off, the app will not connect on its own. For offline viewing, turn on \"Show only photos downloaded to this device\" and download originals in Photos first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
